+# Password Hashing
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on the password hashing algorithm. A decision record for it (`config/decisions/revoke-password-hashing.json`) previously existed in the repository, but it was removed in commit `5ea99fe` ("move decision config out of the tree") along with the rest of the decision config, and no replacement record has been committed since. Until a new decision is recorded, no password hashing algorithm should be treated as settled project policy.
